      "content": "# Configuration for Node in App Engine standard on Google Cloud Platform.\n\nruntime: nodejs12\ninstance_class: F1\n\nhandlers:\n- url: /.*\n  secure: always\n  redirect_http_response_code: 301\n  script: auto\n\nvpc_access_connector:\n  name: projects/rocket-rides/locations/us-central1/connectors/rocketrides-mongo"
